  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** 8 and 3\n\n**Given:**\n\n**186 ÷ 17 + 104 - 12 × 3 = 16**\n\n**After interchange the signs;**\n\n**136 ÷ 17 + 104 - 12 × 8 = 16**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**8 + 104 - 12 × 8 = 16**\n\n**8 + 104 - 96 = 16**\n\n**112 - 96 = 16**\n\n**16 = 16 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 :** 4 and 7\n\nGiven: \n\n186 ÷ 17 + 104 - 12 × 3 = 16\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n186 ÷ 14 + 107 - 12 × 3 = 16\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n13.28 + 107 - 12 × 3 = 16\n\n13.28 + 107 - 36 = 16\n\n120.28 - 36 = 16\n\n84.28 = 16** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: **2 and 7\n\nGiven:\n\n186 ÷ 17 + 104 - 12 × 3 = 16\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n186 ÷ 12 + 104 - 17 × 3 = 16\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n15.5 + 104 - 17 × 3 = 16\n\n15.5 + 104 - 51 = 16\n\n119.5 - 51 = 16\n\n68.5 = 16 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4: **6 and 4\n\nGiven:\n\n186 ÷ 17 + 104 - 12 × 3 = 16\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n184 ÷ 17 + 106 - 12 × 3 = 14\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n10.82 + 106 - 12 × 3 = 14\n\n10.82 + 106 - 36 = 14\n\n116.82 - 36 = 14\n\n80.82 = 14 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****8 and 3”.**",
